**scheduler.hpp defines scheduler pipeline dispatch and shutdown hooks.**

## API

`scheduler::pipeline`: `async`, `renderer`, `main`, `count`; `cond_continue=false`, `cond_end=true`.

`scheduler::on_shutdown(const std::function<void()>&)`; `schedule`, `loop`, `once` accept callbacks, `pipeline`, `std::chrono::milliseconds delay=0ms`; `schedule` returns `void` but callback returns `bool`.